Z||000006||Raydar||05-25-2001||02:38 PM||||When they start squeaking, it doesn't mean that the brakes are completely shot. You can still drive for a few days. Brake gently, though. Avoid stop and go traffic. The linings are paper-thin. Get 'em replaced ASAP. <BR>This does NOT mean "next month". <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 Duke coupe <BR>88 "wadded up" Formula (parts car)||||reg||1
